1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,360
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 4=

3
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:41,619
Nothing happened last night.

4
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,259
What?

5
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,560
So this morning,

6
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,799
watching me panic...

7
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,739
That was fun for you?

8
00:01:25,739 --> 00:01:26,439
It wasn't fun.

9
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,500
I meant it. I like you.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,640
I...

11
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:34,140
I was just thinking,

12
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:36,340
if I gave you the wrong idea,

13
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:38,519
then maybe

14
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:42,599
you'd see me as an ordinary man
you could date.

15
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,200
I was afraid that if I told you,

16
00:01:45,659 --> 00:01:47,920
I'd only ever be
your BFF's younger brother.

17
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,480
I know that was childish,

18
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,540
but...

19
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:58,359
I didn't know what else to do.

20
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,259
The egg tarts are really good.

21
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,580
I know how you feel about me.

22
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,900
But right now,

23
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:38,560
I can't see you as just another suitor.

24
00:02:40,539 --> 00:02:42,060
You're my BFF's brother.

25
00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:43,000
I'm her best friend.

26
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,960
That won't change.

27
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:45,860
So,

28
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,159
you'll still call me sis.

29
00:02:54,259 --> 00:02:54,860
It's okay.

30
00:02:56,379 --> 00:02:58,340
I'll wait until you say yes.

31
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,040
Good night.

32
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,620
(It was supposed to be just dinner.)

33
00:05:00,939 --> 00:05:03,120
(How did we end up in bed again?)

34
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:23,560
Mr. Liu.

35
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,759
Though we've only just met today,

36
00:05:26,019 --> 00:05:27,300
I'm really disappointed in you.

37
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,100
I'm sorry, Ms. Wang.

38
00:05:29,379 --> 00:05:30,759
I just took over your case.

39
00:05:30,939 --> 00:05:32,339
I'm reviewing it as fast as I can.

40
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,480
Ms. Wang.

41
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,019
Ms. Wen.

42
00:05:39,259 --> 00:05:40,120
What is it?

43
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,259
We're in a meeting.

44
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,120
I know.

45
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:43,980
But I've found something

46
00:05:44,339 --> 00:05:45,920
I must discuss with Ms. Wang in person.

47
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:47,800
Ms. Wen.

48
00:05:48,339 --> 00:05:50,319
Mr. Liu is handling this case now.

49
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:53,019
The defendant bought

50
00:05:53,019 --> 00:05:54,579
this overseas property last month

51
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:56,399
in a distant relative's name.

52
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:57,560
I believe

53
00:05:57,779 --> 00:06:00,000
it's key evidence
for the division of assets.

54
00:06:04,379 --> 00:06:06,519
No wonder I couldn't find it.

55
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,680
What is this, Ms. Wen?

56
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,160
This evidence wasn't

57
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,579
in the files you handed over.

58
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,199
It wasn't in those files.

59
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:13,259
I found it

60
00:06:13,259 --> 00:06:14,879
reviewing the case again last night.

61
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:16,259
The copy of the deed

62
00:06:16,259 --> 00:06:17,519
only came in this morning.

63
00:06:22,579 --> 00:06:23,180
Ms. Wang.

64
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:24,720
I know

65
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:26,100
you've recently

66
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:28,000
heard rumors about me.

67
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:30,899
I did get involved with a man

68
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:33,560
without knowing he was married.

69
00:06:34,459 --> 00:06:35,560
But please believe me,

70
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,240
it won't affect my judgment as a lawyer.

71
00:06:37,339 --> 00:06:38,160
Quite the opposite.

72
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,519
As a woman,

73
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,600
I understand all too well

74
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,160
how betrayal in a marriage feels.

75
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:44,920
You hired our firm

76
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,480
because your husband cheated.

77
00:06:46,819 --> 00:06:48,259
You want a fair share

78
00:06:48,259 --> 00:06:49,519
of the marital assets.

79
00:06:50,060 --> 00:06:50,779
Rest assured,

80
00:06:51,399 --> 00:06:53,220
I'll handle every detail with care

81
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:55,100
and fight for everything

82
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,360
you're legally entitled to,

83
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:58,319
so you can leave this marriage soon.

84
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:00,420
Please keep trusting me.

85
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,399
Let me be your lead counsel.

86
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,540
I'd rather trust

87
00:07:29,019 --> 00:07:30,459
someone who takes the job seriously.

88
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:41,819
Fine.

89
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:45,379
We'll do as you wish, Ms. Wang.

90
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,040
Thank you, Ms. Wang.

91
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:01,980
Heard the news?

92
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:03,519
Ms. Wen went into the meeting

93
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:04,879
and took her case back.

94
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,839
Seriously?

95
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:07,360
Hadn't Mr. Liu taken it over?

96
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:09,180
The client said she only trusted her.

97
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:10,000
What could they do?

98
00:08:12,459 --> 00:08:12,920
Ms. Wen.

99
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,500
Ms. Wen.

100
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:23,740
Ms. Wen.

101
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:24,540
Congrats!

102
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:26,459
Get the extra files for the Zhao case

103
00:08:26,459 --> 00:08:27,680
from the Records Department.

104
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:28,939
Okay.

105
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:40,180
(Pei Yiqiu)

106
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:41,580
(All sorted.)

107
00:09:05,539 --> 00:09:06,639
(Wanqing)
All sorted.

108
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,379
That look...

109
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,519
Your girlfriend?

110
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:22,259
Not yet.

111
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:24,500
Still trying, then?

112
00:09:26,419 --> 00:09:28,700
It's a long road ahead.

113
00:09:32,059 --> 00:09:33,779
Who could possibly

114
00:09:34,059 --> 00:09:36,600
make Dr. Pei smile like that?

115
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,240
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
